usage: validate_plugin.py [-h] [--root ROOT] [--skip-host-cli] [--component]
                          [--inventory INVENTORY]

Deterministic Bedrock plugin validation for HEB-108 / minimum HEB-109.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --root ROOT
  --skip-host-cli       Skip Claude CLI plugin-manifest validation (tests
                        only).
  --component           Component checks only: retain historical routing
                        evidence without claiming current routing acceptance.
                        Default still verifies current retained evidence.
  --inventory INVENTORY
                        Write the derived metadata/routing inventory as JSON.
